# Migrating darksoil-studio/tauri-plugin-holochain's holochain_runtime to Holochain 0.7
#
# Applies to `crates/holochain_runtime` of
# https://github.com/darksoil-studio/tauri-plugin-holochain at branch `main`
# (last push 2026-07-16), taken on 2026-10-07. `git apply -p1` from the repo root.
#
# NOT A CONTRIBUTION AND NOT UPSTREAMED. It exists because README §9 records the
# cost of that migration as measured rather than estimated, and a figure with no
# artefact behind it is the kind of claim this repository does not keep. The
# official mobile path is Holochain's own cleanroom implementation, already on
# 0.7 and awaiting permission to reuse a name — so this is a fallback nobody
# currently needs.
#
# WHAT IT IS VERIFIED TO DO: `cargo check` exits 0, on both wasmer backends —
# `wasmer-sys` + `wasmer-sys-cranelift` for desktop and Android, and
# `wasmer-wasmi`, the interpreted backend iOS requires.
#
# WHAT IT IS NOT VERIFIED TO DO: anything at runtime. It was never built, never
# tested, and no mobile artefact was produced from it. `tauri-plugin-holochain`
# itself, `hc-pilot` and the scaffold crates are untouched.
#
# It will rot: it is a patch against a third-party `main`. The per-change
# reasoning is in README §9, which survives the rot.

